{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14213","headline":"晚次荆江 · 戎昱","name":"晚次荆江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤舟大江水，水涉无昏曙。\n雨暗迷津时，云生望乡处。\n渔翁闲自乐，樵客纷多虑。\n秋色湖上山，归心日边树。\n徒称竹箭美，未得枫林趣。\n向夕垂钓还，吾从落潮去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}